
                 JEOPopFiles v1.03 - by Jan Erik Olausen
                 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
  JEOPopFiles generates an ANSI-file over the most popular files.

  *** Now working with ABBS 2.xx only. ABBS v1.x users must use v1.02 ***

  Here's what to do:

  JEOPopFiles 15 Bulletins:NEWS11

  Where:

                15 = # of popular files (1 - 20)
  Bulletins:NEWS10 = Where to store the generated ANSI-file. * = screen
                     If you want users to grab bulletins, don't use the
                     .ansi extention.

  If you want to exclude files (such as file lists), you can put them in
  'S:JEOPopFiles.exclude'.

  If you want to exclude whole file directories, you can put them in
  'S:JEOPopFiles.dir_exclude'.
  Excluded directories are not included in the total statestics.

  That's all...

